Hi all,
I have now succeeded in installing Rgraphviz correctly now with version 2.20 of Graphviz.
I found that the problem, this time, was the absence of Graphviz in the path.
On adding it to the path, I could run the library(Rgraphviz) command without getting any error messages.

I checked in the following folder : C:\Program\Graphviz2.20\bin and found that it contained libcdt-4.dll. 
(Strangely enough, it was version 2.20 and not 2.21 as shown in the Start->All Programs tab).

This confirms your experience that the installation works with version 2.20 of Graphviz.
As Sim says, it was most probably the absence of libcdt-4.dll in version 2.22.2 of Graphviz that was the culprit.
Thanking you,
Ravi



